usage: train_baseline_models_with_sd.py [-h] --input INPUT [--outdir OUTDIR]
                                        [--seeds SEEDS [SEEDS ...]]
                                        [--threads THREADS]

Train baseline models with enriched dynamic features and output mean ± SD over
multiple random seeds

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input INPUT         Path to prematch_features.csv
  --outdir OUTDIR       Directory to save metrics and ROC figures
  --seeds SEEDS [SEEDS ...]
                        Random seeds for repeated runs
  --threads THREADS     Explicit CatBoost CPU threads
